There is also a paper-level coherence problem outside the files listed: `paper/sections/5_conclusion.tex` still tells the old router/fusion story and says the real end-to-end agent trails fusion by 5.4 pp on Qwen3.5. That directly conflicts with the new abstract/main table, so I’m treating it as a submission-blocking narrative consistency issue, not just polish.
